joins :- A join is a query that combines rows from two or more tables , views, materialized view.
===> TYPES OF JOINS 
1. INNER JOIN -> matched data only
2. OUTER JOIN
3. SELF JOIN
4. CROSS JOIN
5. SEMI JOIN
6. ANTI JOIN

--> INNER JOIN:- INNER JOIN is used to combine two tables and return only the rows where the join condition matches. Non-matching rows are NOT included.
